	depends on PQCP_ACVP
	default 2000
	range 100 60000
	help
	  Timeout used by the serial ACVP sample once a host starts sending a
	  command line. If the newline terminator does not arrive within this
	  window, the sample drops the partial frame, emits ERROR:TIMEOUT, and
	  waits for the next command.

