	bool "Limit ACVP KAT ztest to a smoke subset"
	depends on PQCP_ACVP
	default n
	help
	  Limit the ACVP known-answer ztest suite to a small deterministic subset
	  for fast pull-request smoke runs. Leave this disabled for release gates
	  so every vendored NIST KAT vector is exercised.

endif # PQCP_ACVP

endmenu

